   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T13:50:04+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "Birth dated from the conception plus nine months (about 86.15 years from anchor.abraham_birth), agreeing with 16:16 (86 years); the proposal was moved to 85.4 years to make both verses hold. I did not anchor twice on abraham_birth. Hagar's return to Sarai (commanded in 16:9) is not narrated and has no event; the birth in the household is implied by 16:15 (Abram names the child)."
   ],
   "history": [
    {
     "status": "changes_requested",
     "at": "2026-11-02T13:49:24+00:00",
     "note": "[blocker] Make the linked birth fall at age 86 (86.0 to 87.0 years after anchor.abraham_birth): the stated age wins. Either anchor the birth on anchor.abraham_birth START with offset 86 years (margin about 6 months), or keep the nine-month chain and move the proposal later (see sarai_proposes) so that conception + 9 months lands at 86; correct the temporal_reasoning_note accordingly. (GEN.16.16: \"וְאַבְרָם בֶּן־שְׁמֹנִים שָׁנָה וְשֵׁשׁ שָׁנִים\" (Abram was fourscore and six years old when Hagar bare Ishmael))",
     "by": "urim-critic@3 · claude-opus-5-5"
